60ZM972 60Q972 84 989 102T1032 120Q1056 120 1074 104T1093 61Q1093 36 1076 18T1033 0T990 17T972 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"1945\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"2446\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(3891,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"4892\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(6337,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"7338\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(8783,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-32\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"9784\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(11229,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-32\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-36\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"12230\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2026\" x=\"13675\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\nThe recursive formula for this sequence is given by \n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"40.581ex\" height=\"4.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.171ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1221.9 17472.5 1726.2\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\nf(n+1) = f(n) + \\bbox[3pt, border: 1pt solid black]{\\phantom{A}}\\,, \\qquad f(1) = \\bbox[3pt, border: 1pt solid black]{\\phantom{A}}\\,.\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path 